{"blocks":[{"context":"body","count":1,"en":"Redesigned the whole thing. Green, brown, DAGs everywhere. It feels like\nme now.","kind":"para"},{"context":"body","count":1,"en":"Set up Hermes on an old HP Pavilion. Named my bot Merlin Vieira saar.\nMiMo voice is insane.","kind":"para"},{"context":"body","count":1,"en":"The hour was always a proxy for value. AI just made the proxy collapse.","kind":"para"},{"context":"body","count":1,"en":"just random thoughts, things I'm working on, stuff I find interesting.\nno structure, no plan. sometimes about Bayesian stuff, sometimes about\nthe site, sometimes just whatever.","kind":"para"},{"context":"body","count":1,"en":"Aug 9, 2026","kind":"plain"},{"context":"body","count":3,"en":"Carlos Trujillo","kind":"plain"},{"context":"body","count":1,"en":"Jul 5, 2026","kind":"plain"},{"context":"body","count":1,"en":"Jul 6, 2026","kind":"plain"},{"context":"body","count":1,"en":"`<a href=\"/diary/2026-07-05.qmd\" class=\"no-external\">`{=html}new site\nwho dis`</a>`{=html}","kind":"plain"},{"context":"body","count":1,"en":"`<a href=\"/diary/2026-07-06.qmd\" class=\"no-external\">`{=html}merlin\nvieira saar`</a>`{=html}","kind":"plain"},{"context":"body","count":1,"en":"`<a href=\"/diary/2026-08-09.qmd\" class=\"no-external\">`{=html}hourly\nbilling is dead, long live the hybrid`</a>`{=html}","kind":"plain"}],"envelope":[{"en":"Diary — Carlos Trujillo","render_id":"cXVhcnRvLW1ldGF0aXRsZQ=="},{"en":"Marketing Science Blog","render_id":"cXVhcnRvLW1ldGFzaXRlbmFtZQ=="},{"en":"Daily notes, progress and random stuff from Carlos Trujillo’s work on Bayesian causal inference, marketing mix modeling, causal discovery and beyond.","render_id":"cXVhcnRvLW9nY2FyZGRkZXNj"},{"en":"Diary — Carlos Trujillo","render_id":"cXVhcnRvLW9nY2FyZHRpdGxl"},{"en":"/about.html","render_id":"cXVhcnRvLWludC1uYXZiYXI6L2Fib3V0Lmh0bWw="},{"en":"/articles.html","render_id":"cXVhcnRvLWludC1uYXZiYXI6L2FydGljbGVzLmh0bWw="},{"en":"/diary.html","render_id":"cXVhcnRvLWludC